Compiler that transforms steno-theory source files (`.steno`) to Plover JSON dictionaries, LSP snippets, and structural blocks via a strict forward pipeline: parse source text to an entry AST, expand to handle fan-out and type-append chains, then render output artifacts.

Data flows unidirectionally through three main passes with no backtracking; errors are typed and carry 1-based source line numbers when applicable. The library exports the full AST, intermediate representations, and rendering functions used by four binaries (`build-dict`, `build-nvim`, `measure`, `viz-data`), but those binaries alone write output files — library code never does.